    "value such as m = 500 belongs to the band '0 <= m <= 500'.",
    "procedures of the catalogue. They are configuration data, not verified metrological truth: the",
    "confirms every factor, unit and clause reference against the controlled OIML text.",
    "This ruleset is inactive by default and applies only after System Administrator activation."
